{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">深井昨晚（23 日）發生一宗交通意外，引發嚴重交通擠塞。約下午 6 時 48 分，一輛私家車沿青山公路青龍頭段往屯門方向行駛，當駛至浪翠園對開位置時，突然失控自炒撞向鐵欄。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"753541172_10164491173635020_4799953509410742972_n.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026jUf6zqhRtp1784861743.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"網上圖片\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">網上圖片</span>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"753605142_10164491173240020_2944989164167765788_n.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026gWWD4hauiu1784861748.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"網上圖片\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">網上圖片</span>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">涉事私家車車頭嚴重凹陷，整輛車橫亙在路中心。由於事發時正值收工尖峰時間，意外導致現場嚴重塞車，車龍一度倒塞至屯門公路往屯門方向的深井出口。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"深井私家車自炒釀大塞車\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026GsrnDqyXzG1784861806.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"網上圖片\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">網上圖片</span>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-24-10h36m04s141.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20263R90YqNIrS1784861833.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"網上圖片\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">網上圖片</span>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"vlcsnap-2026-07-24-10h36m11s298.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026Cfak1XyJQN1784861838.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"網上圖片\"/>\n</div>\n<div class=\"image-caption\" style=\"padding: 8px 12px; background: rgb(245, 247, 250); border-top: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237); font-size: 12px; color: rgb(96, 98, 102); line-height: 1.5;\">\n<span class=\"img-description\">網上圖片</span>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">據網上流傳的影片顯示，至晚上約 8 時，懷疑因現場交通極度嚴重擠塞，拖車未能及時趕抵現場處理事故，為儘快恢復交通，現場交通警員與二十多名熱心市民合力，嘗試將涉事私家車推開。期間，有女士在旁大聲呼籲及協調：「有冇多少少男士可以幫手？」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-24T03:40:22.492706+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":298,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}